        "id": 147061,
        "name": "dclietz",
        "username": "dclietz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-24T18:45:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just wondering did you play the other one shots that showed up when Infinitor was going through his deck to get four manifestations in play? &nbsp;It should work similar to the Matriarch with the mask where the one shots resolve after the four manifestations are in play. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I stacked Infinitor's deck as well, so he never played any one shots. The only time a one shot came up was for Ocular Swarm flips.</p>",
