        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-26T16:01:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just tried Knyfe, Chrono Ranger, AZ and won on turn 4.&nbsp;<span>By Any Means from Chrono and the combo of Battlefield Experience + Greater Good (+ BE + GG +...) from Knyfe and 4x Eye on the Prize pumped by Hunter and Hunted makes for a quick game. However, I was fairly low on HP. Without Chrono I don't know if you could deal damage fast enough with just Knyfe.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Also,&nbsp;</span><span>probably AZ is the worst against Infinitor (he just takes so long to build up) but Ra + AZ would be an easy win (just don't destroy the fire guys from Infinitor), so that eliminates Ra.&nbsp;</span></p><p>I'm now thinking this pool of heroes remains to test:&nbsp;<span>Bunker, AA, AZ, Knyfe, Expat.&nbsp;</span></p>",
