        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-25T21:56:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Been quite a while, but I finally made time to test AA, Bunker, and AZ in this scenario. It wasn't an easy win, but comfortable enough, and we won on turn 4. &nbsp;</p><p>Who was I to think that AA wouldn't rule in a stacked deck scenario? He handed out so many card plays that AZ was all set up on turn 2, then buffed his damage, at which point AZ just takes over. &nbsp;</p><p>So, only Bunker, AZ, Knyfe, and Expat remain to test.</p>",
