      {
        "id": 147064,
        "name": "dclietz",
        "username": "dclietz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-25T23:21:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Achievement unlocked! I was able to beat advanced Infinitor in Rook City with Bunker, AZ, and Expat (due primarily to sub-zero atmosphere, with that card out, flipped Infinitor just deals 8 damage per turn which you can race). Next,&nbsp;<span>Bunker, Knyfe, and Expat combined were able to just finish Infinitor before he ran out of weaker manifestations to play. They could have survived one more round, which meant that really they could have beaten Infinitor even if he had more HP, maybe 100.&nbsp;</span></p><p>So I do believe that every villian on advanced, in every environment, can in fact be defeated by any hero team! Unless there is a harder combination that I'm not aware of.&nbsp;</p>",
