        "created_at": "2016-04-07T15:44:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When the deck reshuffles, put both Thieves on top.  One of DW Nightmist’s incap abilities is to put the top card of a trash on top of that deck.  So, an Aimed Hairtrigger Reflexes, combined with that ability can completely lock down the Chairman.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am thinking that Rook City won’t let that situation last very long.</p>",
